    "title": "Texas faces life-threatening flash flooding as Edouard slams region with heavy rain",
    "slug": "texas-faces-life-threatening-flash-flooding-as-edouard-slams",
    "excerpt": "Parts of southeast Texas are facing life-threatening flash flooding on Wednesday as the remnants of Tropical Storm Edouard slam the region with heavy rain.",
    "content": "<p class=\"jxTEW Poyse ouIFx uieav lqtkC HkWF HfYhe kGyAC \"><span>A level 4 of 4 -- the highest level for flash flooding -- has been issued.</span></p><p class=\"EkqkG IGXmU nlgHS yuUao MvWXB TjIXL aGjvy ebVHC \">Parts of southeast Texas are facing life-threatening flash flooding on Wednesday as the remnants of <a href=\"https://abcnews.com/video/136136780/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Tropical Storm Edouard</a> slam the region with heavy rain.</p><p class=\"EkqkG IGXmU nlgHS yuUao lqtkC TjIXL aGjvy \">A flash flood emergency was issued in Hardin and Tyler counties where 10 to 21 inches of rain has fallen so far with rainfall rates reaching a whopping 5 inches per hour.</p><figure class=\"kzIjN GNmeK pYrtp dSqFO \" data-testid=\"prism-figure\"><div><div><picture><source></source><source></source><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://i.abcnewsfe.com/a/3d5fde26-6281-409f-bfea-5b6ac4ff1c54/Edouard-2-ht-gmh-260902_1788354649684_hpMain.jpg\"></picture></div></div><figcaption><div><div><span><span><span>Heavy rain from Tropical Storm Edouard falls in Beaumont, Texas, Sept. 1, 2026.</span></span></span></div><div><span>@StormChaserHTX/X</span></div></div></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"kzIjN GNmeK pYrtp dSqFO \" data-testid=\"prism-figure\"><div><div><picture><source></source><source></source><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://i.abcnewsfe.com/a/ae74e3f8-3ba6-48b4-8947-2da8fe9f918c/edouard-4-gty-gmh-260901_1788317954657_hpMain.jpg\"></picture></div></div><figcaption><div><div><span><span><span>Tropical Storm Edouard passes over Beaumont, September 1, 2026, in Beaumont, Texas.</span></span></span></div><div><span>Antranik Tavitian/Getty Images</span></div></div></figcaption></figure><p class=\"EkqkG IGXmU nlgHS yuUao lqtkC TjIXL aGjvy \">Flash flooding has also been reported in Liberty and Polk counties, where 4-to-16 inches of rain has been recorded so far. In Polk County, Judge Sydney Murphy has issued a Local Declaration of Disaster.</p><p class=\"EkqkG IGXmU nlgHS yuUao lqtkC TjIXL aGjvy \">A level 4 of 4 -- the highest level for flash flooding -- has been issued for the region as the life-threatening conditions are expected to continue into the afternoon, with rainfall rates possibly reaching 4 inches per hour.</p><figure class=\"kzIjN GNmeK pYrtp dSqFO \" data-testid=\"prism-figure\"><div><div><picture><source></source><source></source><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://i.abcnewsfe.com/a/ac84f8c4-981e-4c64-9e77-a62bf0d08171/edouard-3-gty-gmh-260901_1788317954594_hpMain.jpg\"></picture></div></div><figcaption><div><div><span><span><span>A damaged G.I. Surplus store is seen during Tropical Storm Edouard, September 1, 2026, in Beaumont, Texas.</span></span></span></div><div><span>Antranik Tavitian/Getty Images</span></div></div></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"kzIjN GNmeK pYrtp dSqFO \" data-testid=\"prism-figure\"><div><div><picture><source></source><source></source><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://i.abcnewsfe.com/a/ff0d4724-ad1f-4542-bcfd-ac4b3a9fc6c5/Edouard-1-gty-gmh-260902_1788354287997_hpMain.jpg\"></picture></div></div><figcaption><div><div><span><span><span>A man tries to hold onto an umbrella as he walks out of an H-E-B as Tropical Storm Edouard approaches, September 1, 2026, in Port Arthur, Texas.</span></span></span></div><div><span>Antranik Tavitian/Getty Images</span></div></div></figcaption></figure><p class=\"EkqkG IGXmU nlgHS yuUao lqtkC TjIXL aGjvy \">Flood watches also extend into the cities of Houston and College Station.</p><h2 class=\"KuBvM RTkZF lFzlq GbVC HkWF exKgG kGyAC SwCrv \">Popular Reads</h2><h2 class=\"PFoxV eBpQD rcQBv bQtjQ lQUdN GpQCA mAkiF FvMyr WvoqU nPLLM tuAKv \" id=\"136137943headline\">Woman needs 38 stitches after otter attack</h2><ul class=\"tfFRZ zOGtW VZTD UeCOM RzKoN JEct YaqUo BedyR UoVV WtEci dSKvB seFhp \"><li><div><span><span>1 day ago</span></span></div></li></ul><h2 class=\"PFoxV eBpQD rcQBv bQtjQ lQUdN GpQCA mAkiF FvMyr WvoqU nPLLM tuAKv \" id=\"136139131headline\